      "english": "Excuse me!\nI've brought my\n[blue]Dango Shop[/color] ticket stub.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00081D68",
      "source_words_sha256": "87c8a827a2ed34d8fb885265b2fd5af9c3f3e69998d099168e951a1683f43403",
      "english": "...Tell the [blue]Dango Shop[/color] too.\nGin Tama are nice,\nbut the real stuff's better.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00081E14",
      "source_words_sha256": "bc6f042fd076931f7dd3cbe77799c48707b6d7097d6db4a4efc675779200e086",
      "english": "Of course.\nIt's a joint promotion\nwith the [blue]Dango Shop[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
