      "source_words_sha256": "88abd1d9a40600dd255a96914dc83a32fa1eb46ce5f5063a39860ee54d0513ff",
      "english": "The [blue]Dango Shop[/color] and I\nfigured only Gin Tama\nwould win customers now.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
